        <h3 class="mt-2 font-[var(--font-display)] text-lg font-medium text-[var(--tb-c-text-1)] group-hover:text-[var(--tb-c-accent)]">Migrating from tebako v1</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--tb-c-text-2)]">
          The gem, the merged env+app image, and the old CLI flags are gone — deliberately.
          The migration guide maps every v1 habit to its current form.
        </p>
      </a>
    </div>
</DocsLayout>
